{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず！\nらりん！きゃっぷ（桜井さん）19歳のお誕生日おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/19/7056170/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/19/7056170/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/19/7056170/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/19/7056170/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/19/7056170/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/19/7056170/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/19/7056170/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりん！\nいつも乃木坂に明るい笑顔を広めてくれてありがとう！\nらりんの笑顔めちゃくちゃ好きだよー(*´∇｀)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃっぷ！\nいつも乃木坂を代表して前に出てくれてありがとう！\nきゃっぷをいじるの大好きヽ(・∀・)ﾉ\nなんだかんだ信頼してます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもお二人ともよろしくね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/19/7056170/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツーショット！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/05/19/7056170/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃっぷ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日いろいろ動いてます！\nプリンシパルをやったあとだからかな？\n自分の魅せ方とか考えるようになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技はうまくないけれど、自分が得意なもので魅せていけるようになりたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのためにはこのままじゃ足りないのよね〜\nいろいろ直していかないとな。\n高めていかないとな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今めちゃくちゃやる気がみなぎっております！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わりたいな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もあるので寝ますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お疲れ様でした〜\nへばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}